Package: svora-agent-master
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: bitia <root@alev.pro>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sibatabot/agent-master
Depends: libc6
Description: AgentMaster — owns one process and the terminal it runs in
 Runs a single program under a terminal of its own and hands control of it
 over a port: start it, read its window, type into it, resize the window,
 read its clipboard, stop it, ask how it ended.
 .
 Installed as /usr/bin/svora-am. Whoever needs one starts it — the svora
 supervisor starts one per agent — so this package ships no service unit
 and enables nothing.
